Once the dough has[ rested enough] (a[ few hours] or[ days]),[ roll out] and[ place] into a 9 inch fluted tart pan (this will also work in a pie dish). Place in freezer[ while you make] the filling and topping.
D[ice] nectarines (leave the skin on) and[ combine] with sugar, flour, cinnamon and rum.[ Set aside] and[ make] the topping. In a bowl, combine ingredients for[ filling].[ Using] your fingers, work ingredients[ together] (feel free to add more pistachios if you’d like) until[ the] texture of coarse crumbs.
