The Medical Performers Lists in Wales will be amended to[ provide] G[Ps who] wish to work[ outside] the[ UK] the[ opportunity] to remain on the list for[ a maximum] of[ five years].
This will mean that[ returning] GPs will no longer have to[ undertake] the induction and refresher scheme.
